{
  "job_B8.1.4.3_20251003_114813": {
    "chunk_text": "folce, \u00fe\u00e6t hi offrion for synne buccan & cealf & lamb, \u00e6lc anwintre & unwemme; Hi namon \u00fea ealle \u00f0a \u00f0ingc \u00f0e Moyses him bebead, & brohton to \u00f0\u00e6s temples dura. & Moyses cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam folce: Wyrcea\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten eow bebead, & Drihten eow \u00e6tyw\u00f0. \u00d0a Aaron geofrod h\u00e6fde & \u00f0\u00e6t folc gebletsod, swa Moyses him bebead, \u00f0a eode he ny\u00f0er; \u00f0a & com fyr of Gode & forb\u00e6rnde ealle \u00f0a ofrunga \u00fee uppan \u00feam weofode w\u00e6ron; & \u00f0a \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00fe\u00e6t \u00deA namon Aarones suna, Nadab & Abiud, heora storcyllan, & on\u00e6ldon \u00fe\u00e6ron unhalgod fyr, \u00f0\u00e6t him & fyr com \u00fe\u00e6rrihte & forb\u00e6rnde hi to dea\u00f0e. \u00dea swugode Aaron & w\u00e6s sarig. \u00d0a bead Moyses Missabele & Elifafan, Aczicheles sunum, Aarones f\u00e6deran, \u00f0\u00e6t hi namon heora & hi eodon sona & b\u00e6ron hi aweg & wurpon hi ut, swa him beboden w\u00e6s. Moyses cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Aarone & to Eleazare & to I\u00f0amare, his sunon: Forl\u00e6ta\u00f0 eowre hreowsunga, \u00f0e l\u00e6s Drihten spr\u00e6c to Aarone & to his sunum: Ne drince ge nan \u00f0ingc \u00f0\u00e6s \u00f0e man m\u00e6g druncen of beon Drihten spr\u00e6c to Moyse & to Aarone: Secga\u00f0 Israhela bearnum, \u00f0\u00e6t hi eton \u00fea nytenu \u00f0e heora clawa Ne ete ge \u00fea \u00f0ingc \u00f0e ceowa\u00f0 & clawa ne to",
